      "content": "thanks for those. i see what u mean about the vibes. but honestly, the progressive one feels a bit too much like a caricature... like they're just angry for the sake of being angry. can we try again? \n\ncan u rewrite the progressive monologue so they sound more intellectual and composed? i want them to make a really strong, logical argument for systemic change so the audience actually respects their point of view, rather than just seeing them as an 'intense' person. keep the traditionalist one the same though, i liked that one.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
